   "notes": "This is a derived Delta-comparison reference curve, not a fit to one experimental P-V dataset. V0, K0, and K0-prime were compiled from heterogeneous sources; the review authors approximately corrected V0 and K0 to a static-lattice 0 K comparison state and explicitly left K0-prime uncorrected.",
   "pressure_calibration": {
