     "finding": "The CC BY archive prints a per-atom V0, B0, and B0-prime comparison triplet. The paper and supplement show that the fields are separately compiled properties rather than row-level observations or coefficients from one experimental fit."
    },
    "primary_data_check": {
     "status": "parameterization_only",
